h_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-b5[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Bead pages associate every repo's commits and always link their [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]agents[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]A published bead page lists every commit and agent actually [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]associated with that bead lineage — no matter which of the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]project's repositories the commit landed in — links each commit to [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]its own owning repository, links every agent to its agents-sidecar [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]page, and can never again be emptied by a commit made outside the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]primary repository.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202607/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bead_page_association_anchors.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-b5[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-b5/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Sidecar-aware primary checkout and owning-project resolver[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]anchor[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]anchor: add a shared resolver that maps any path inside a managed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]checkout — including a sidecar or linked-repo clone nested under it — to[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]that checkout's primary repository root and canonical project name, with[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]marker-first resolution and explicit fallbacks.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Anchor bead-page publication and refresh on the resolved [/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]primary repository[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]publish[dim] · [dim][/dim]after anchor[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]publish: stop letting the committing repository masquerade as the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]primary repository by routing the post-commit bead-page publication and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the pages-refresh CLI through the shared resolver, so a commit made in a[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sidecar can no longer erase a lineage's associations.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Resolve agent links from any repository in the workspace[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]agentlinks[dim] · [dim][/dim]after anchor[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]agentlinks: make the hosted agents-sidecar remote lookup and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]SASE_AGENT commit-footer tag resolve the owning project through the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]shared resolver instead of naming the current working directory's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]repository, so agent labels stop rendering and committing unlinked.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Associate bead commits across every repository the project [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]owns[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]multirepo[dim] · [dim][/dim]after anchor, publish[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]multirepo: walk the primary repository plus every locally cloned sidecar[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and linked repository when deriving bead associations, carry each [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]commit's owning repository through the association records, and resolve [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]commit URLs against that repository's own remote.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Regenerate degraded pages and verify the sase-b3 lineage end [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]to end[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]repair[dim] · [dim][/dim]after publish, agentlinks, multirepo[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]repair: republish every generated bead page from the corrected [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]projection, confirm the sase-b3 lineage reports the associations its [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]commits prove, and add a guard that fails when a published page links a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]commit to a sidecar remote.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-b5","llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","phase_bead_id":"sase-b5.1","reasoning_effort":"medium","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-0e2754719a86b27976d36600509f3983","started_at":"2026-07-30T11:22:37.675166+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1785415179,"sha":"5ba1f08d0262d14300f295b60b8fee2df3866d50","subject":"fix: anchor bead page publication on primary checkout"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"2db6b89e26cc8a987050a1faaebf130995d019cfa364538a47e25f49349c3ab9","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-b5.2/chat.md","size_bytes":13439},"commits":{"digest":"523869eb398686f0c12a388a96987dd2259b1d991c852e3b4df119153d48b939","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-b5.2/commits.json","size_bytes":231},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-b5.2/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"c4497dfb0bfb9184d2e2b859b5e64e692e81689b76c0b109966b3ab11faeb81c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-b5.2/meta.json","size_bytes":600},"prompt":{"digest":"90136a9865126d5f99baf651708e7c14a0066bab0d66e90dcfe693ffeb649457","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-b5.2/prompt.md","size_bytes":153},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"2b0fd8f143bfcb774f29ed8272a454ab80a9070e48308b63d83c05409800a86a","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-b5.2/prompt_steps.json